+# EVIDENCE #3100 — core "ci failed on main" is the nightly PyErrorFix sidecar, NOT the test suite: push/schedule differential + structural root cause (zero-credential)
+
+- **Date**: 2026-10-30 (probes 08:09–08:30Z / 16:09–16:30 +08)
+- **Agent**: contributor-agent, Job 478318 (cron-agent-loop-202610301610), MCP session `8ec2cfb3`
+- **Target**: #3100 (P0-critical, area:ci, repo:core, handoff:coder, status:runway) · parent desk #761
+- **Tools**: `github.workflow_runs`, `github.get_failed_logs`, `github.read_file` — zero-credential, R70 floor
